# ArduCopter attitude-rate / gyro-filter tuning for the sim iris.
#
# Purpose: the stock gazebo-iris gains produce a small, fast roll/pitch
# twitch (visible as vibration in the gimbal camera feed and as jitter in the
# visual target track). Lower rate D-terms, lower D-term filter cut-offs, a
# softer rate P, a slower attitude input time constant and a lower gyro
# low-pass all calm that down.
#
# Loaded at SITL start by sim_launch.py via --add-param-file (after
# copter.parm, gazebo-iris.parm and the gimbal file, so these values win).
# No reboot needed; parameters are applied before the vehicle boots.

ATC_RAT_RLL_D      0.002
ATC_RAT_PIT_D      0.002
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD   10
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD   10
ATC_RAT_RLL_P      0.10
ATC_RAT_PIT_P      0.10
ATC_INPUT_TC       0.20
INS_GYRO_FILTER    15
